              "textSha256": "bae5f7663a4beb6badbfada15d469dce4d770d59fe1aee679bfaca732ee7fdcf"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "text": "Spend the day at leisure. Optional excursions include a helicopter tour over Angel Falls or a scenic flight by plane. You can also book a helicopter tour to Angel Falls and Kavak Canyon, a flight over the falls and Kavak, a hike up Kurawaina Tepuy, a visit to the Blue Lagoon or Sacaica Lagoon, paddleboarding or cycling.\n\n**Pemón village: music, dance and local food**\n\nYou can also visit a Pemón village.\n\nFrom February to April, during the dry season, additional options include Orchid Island, Yuri and Yurilu waterfalls, and the natural whirlpools by Golondrina Falls."
    },
